WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,210
As a result, I fell down with one foot.

2
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,370
Go and eat

3
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,300
Manager, here's the thing

4
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,520
Who called the police? What happened?

5
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:20,000
This gentleman just had a conflict with a guest and wanted to take action

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
Is it true that I was stopped by the guest's companion?

7
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:25,360
He was the one who provoked me first. Don't get excited.

8
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,400
If you have anything to do, tell me slowly

9
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,000
Is there surveillance on site? Yes

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,320
The surveillance camera at the door captured it all.

11
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:31,280
You two should go back with us first and cooperate with the investigation.

12
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:37,720
We will handle the specific situation appropriately and well.

13
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,360
Each person gets a bonus of two thousand after work

14
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,310
thank you manager
